   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 70.75,
   "width": 1039.5,
   "height": 45,
   "text": "The context window is the most text a model can read in one request. Percentages are of the usable window\n(the window minus room for the reply). Amness works cheapest first.",
   "originalText": "The context window is the most text a model can read in one request. Percentages are of the usable window\n(the window minus room for the reply). Amness works cheapest first.",
